      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 420bfeba-cd3b-5e05-8dd8-f15cbe774007)
  )
  (text "two diode-isolated hold-up banks: VHOLD_LOGIC (C1+C2 = 9 mF) and VHOLD_RELAY (C4+C5 = 14.7 mF)."
    (at 20 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 71f93a65-a16b-597a-af9f-e191a663d343)
  )
  (text "Reason: the RT1270 terminal voltage collapses to ~3 V during a weld (doc 03 section 3) - rails must not follow it."
